<Project>

  <!-- Repo-wide MSBuild targets — intentionally empty. Being present stops MSBuild from importing a
       Directory.Build.targets from above the repo; being empty means the templates/ subtree (which
       shields itself from the root props with its own sentinel) inherits nothing here either. The
       library's static web assets (src/wwwroot: JS bundle, initializer, api.js, themes) are produced by
       `npm run build`, on purpose not by MSBuild — see README "Building and Running Locally". -->

</Project>
